w: 1.~At the name of Je- sus, Ev- ery knee shall bow,
w: 2.~Might- y and mys- ter- ious In the high- est height,
w: 3.~At His voice cre- a- tion Sprang at once to sight,
w: 4.~Hum- bled for a sea- son, To re- ceive a name
w: 5.~Bore it up tri- um- phant With its hu- man light,
w: 6.~Name Him, bro- thers, name Him, With love strong as death
w: 7.~In your hearts en- throne Him; There let Him sub- due
w: 8.~Bro- thers, this Lord Je- sus Shall re- turn a- gain,
