w: Ev- ery tongue con- fess Him King of glo- ry now;
w: God from ev- er- last- ing, Ver- y light of light:
w: All the an- gel fa- ces, All the hosts of light,
w: From the lips of sin- ners Un- to whom He came,
w: Through all ranks of crea- tures, To the cen- tral height,
w: But with awe and won- der, And with ba- ted breath!
w: All that is not ho- ly, All that is not true;
w: With His Fa- ther’s glo- ry, With His an- gel train;
