w: Who from the be- gin- ning Was the might- y Word.
w: Love, in love e- ter- nal, Rest, in per- fect rest.
w: All the heav’n- ly or- ders, In their great ar- ray.
w: Brought it back vic- tor- ious When from death He passed.
w: Filled it with the glo- ry Of that per- fect rest.
w: Ev- er to be wor- shiped, Tru- sted and a- dored.
w: Let His will en- fold you In its light and power.
w: And our hearts con- fess Him King of glo- ry now.
